  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Illicit Finance Property Research (ICE ODA Project)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is being implemented by Praetorian Connections on behalf of the Centre of Expertise. It will seek to attain a deeper understanding of potential linkages from property purchases in the UK as a potential vector for either laundering illicit proceeds of war or acting as a source of revenue to directly fund conflict in ODA eligible jurisdictions.</narrative>
  </description>
